### Get all branches
GET http://localhost:8080/branches
Accept: application/json

### Get branches count
GET http://localhost:8080/branches/count
Accept: application/json

### Create a branch
POST http://localhost:8080/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ELC Q1",
  "slug": "elc-q1",
  "address": "123 Le Loi, Q1",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "email": "q1@elc.vn",
  "maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/q1",
  "maps_embed": "<iframe></iframe>",
  "description": {"text": "Mo ta"},
  "is_published": true,
  "order_index": 1
}

### Get branch by ID (replace placeholder with real UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/branches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Get branch by Slug
GET http://localhost:8080/branches/slug/elc-q1
Accept: application/json

### Update a branch (replace placeholder with real UUID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/branches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ELC Q1 Updated",
  "address": "123 Le Loi, Q1, HCMC"
}

### Update branch order (replace placeholder with real UUID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/branches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_index": 10
}

### Delete a branch (replace placeholder with real UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/branches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
